  "codes": [
    "Input Representation\n        ↓\nWx + b\n        ↓\nLinear / Affine Transformation\n        ↓\nActivation Function\n        ↓\nNon-linear Transformation\n        ↓\nNew Representation",
    "Input\n  ↓\nLinear\n  ↓\nReLU\n  ↓\nLinear\n  ↓\nReLU\n  ↓\nLinear\n  ↓\nOutput",
    "○ ● ○\n● ○ ●\n○ ● ○",
    "Complex Representation\n        ↓\nLayer 1\n        ↓\nLayer 2\n        ↓\nLayer 3\n        ↓\nSimpler Representation",
    "○ ○ ○ ○ | ● ● ● ●",
    "Raw Input\n   ↓\nLow-level Feature\n   ↓\nIntermediate Feature\n   ↓\nHigh-level Representation\n   ↓\nPrediction"
  ],
  "html": "<h1 id=\"딥러닝은-좌표-변환기인가\">딥러닝은 좌표 변환기인가?</h1>\n<p>딥러닝을 수식만으로 보면 수많은 행렬 곱셈과 활성화 함수가 반복되는 복잡한 계산처럼 보인다.</p>\n<p>하지만 이를 기하학적으로 바라보면 조금 다른 직관을 얻을 수 있다.</p>\n<p>딥러닝의 각 Layer는 입력 데이터를 계속 새로운 표현 공간으로 변환한다.</p>\n<p>따라서 딥러닝을 이해하기 위한 하나의 직관으로</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>복잡한 데이터를 분류하기 쉬운 공간으로 변환하는 과정</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>이라고 생각할 수 있다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"1-linear-transformation\">1. Linear Transformation</h1>\n<p>신경망 Layer의 기본적인 계산은 다음과 같다.</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{z} = \\mathbf{W}\\mathbf{x}+\\mathbf{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.44444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.76944em;vertical-align:-0.08333em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">W</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>여기서</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W}\\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.68611em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">W</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>는 행렬 곱이다.</p>\n<p>선형대수학에서 행렬은 벡터 공간을 변환하는 연산자로 해석할 수 있다.</p>\n<p>행렬에 따라 공간을</p>\n<ul>\n<li>회전(Rotation)</li>\n<li>확대 또는 축소(Scaling)</li>\n<li>기울이기(Shearing)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>등의 방식으로 변환할 수 있다.</p>\n<p>따라서 Weight Matrix <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.68611em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">W</span></span></span></span></span></span>는 입력 데이터가 존재하는 공간을 다른 형태로 변환하는 역할을 한다고 볼 수 있다.</p>\n<hr>\n<div data-fuse=\"incontent_1_articlepage\" data-fuse-code=\"fuse-slot-incontent_1_articlepage-1\" data-fuse-zone-instance=\"zone-instance-incontent_1_articlepage-1\" data-fuse-slot=\"fuse-slot-incontent_1_articlepage-1\" data-gpid=\"/71161633,23323634633/VELOG_velog/incontent_1_articlepage#single-1\" data-fuse-processed-at=\"735\" class=\"fuse-slot-mini-scroller\" style=\"min-height: 250px;\"><div class=\"publift-widget-articlepage_interscroller_1-container\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\">\n      \n        <div class=\"publift-widget-articlepage_interscroller_1-scroll-clip\">\n          <div class=\"publift-widget-articlepage_interscroller_1 publift-widget-interscroller\"><div id=\"fuse-injected-articlepage_interscroller_1-1\" data-fuse=\"articlepage_interscroller_1\" data-fuse-injected-at=\"1793524887710\" class=\"fuse-slot-interscroller\" data-fuse-code=\"fuse-slot-articlepage_interscroller_1-1\" data-fuse-zone-instance=\"zone-instance-articlepage_interscroller_1-1\" data-fuse-slot=\"fuse-slot-articlepage_interscroller_1-1\" data-gpid=\"/71161633,23323634633/VELOG_velog/articlepage_interscroller_1#single-1\" data-fuse-processed-at=\"734\"><div id=\"fuse-slot-articlepage_interscroller_1-1\" class=\"fuse-slot\" style=\"max-width: inherit; max-height: inherit;\"></div></div></div>\n        </div>\n    </div><div id=\"fuse-slot-incontent_1_articlepage-1\" class=\"fuse-slot\" style=\"max-width: inherit; max-height: inherit;\"></div></div><h2 id=\"2-bias\">2. Bias</h2>\n<p>다음 항은 Bias이다.</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+\\mathbf{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.77777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>Bias는 변환된 공간을 이동시키는 역할을 한다.</p>\n<p>따라서</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{z} = \\mathbf{W}\\mathbf{x}+\\mathbf{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.44444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.76944em;vertical-align:-0.08333em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">W</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>는 단순한 행렬 곱뿐 아니라 이동까지 포함한다.</p>\n<p>엄밀하게는 <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\">b</span></span></span></span></span>가 포함된 이러한 변환을 <strong>Affine Transformation</strong>이라고 한다.</p>\n<p>딥러닝 프레임워크에서는 일반적으로 이러한 연산을 <code>Linear Layer</code> 또는 <code>Dense Layer</code>라는 이름으로 사용한다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"3-하지만-linear-transformation만으로는-부족하다\">3. 하지만 Linear Transformation만으로는 부족하다</h1>\n<p>행렬 곱은 공간을</p>\n<ul>\n<li>회전하고</li>\n<li>늘리고</li>\n<li>줄이고</li>\n<li>기울일 수 있다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>하지만 이러한 연산을 여러 번 수행해도 전체 변환은 여전히 선형적인 성질을 가진다.</p>\n<p>예를 들어</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W}_3 \\mathbf{W}_2 \\mathbf{W}_1 \\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.83611em;vertical-align:-0.15em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">W</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.30110799999999993em\"><span style=\"top:-2.5500000000000003em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">W</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.30110799999999993em\"><span style=\"top:-2.5500000000000003em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">W</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.30110799999999993em\"><span style=\"top:-2.5500000000000003em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>는</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W}_{new}\\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.83611em;vertical-align:-0.15em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">W</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.151392em\"><span style=\"top:-2.5500000000000003em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathdefault mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathdefault mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.02691em\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>로 합칠 수 있다.</p>\n<p>따라서 복잡하게 얽혀 있는 데이터를 선형 변환만으로는 원하는 형태로 충분히 변형하기 어렵다.</p>\n<hr>\n<div data-fuse=\"incontent_2_articlepage\" data-fuse-code=\"fuse-slot-incontent_2_articlepage-1\" data-fuse-zone-instance=\"zone-instance-incontent_2_articlepage-1\" data-fuse-slot=\"fuse-slot-incontent_2_articlepage-1\" data-gpid=\"/71161633,23323634633/VELOG_velog/incontent_2_articlepage#single-1\" data-fuse-processed-at=\"735\" class=\"fuse-slot-mini-scroller\" style=\"min-height: 250px;\"><div class=\"publift-widget-articlepage_interscroller_2-container\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\">\n      \n        <div class=\"publift-widget-articlepage_interscroller_2-scroll-clip\">\n          <div class=\"publift-widget-articlepage_interscroller_2 publift-widget-interscroller\"><div id=\"fuse-injected-articlepage_interscroller_2-1\" data-fuse=\"articlepage_interscroller_2\" data-fuse-injected-at=\"1793524887710\" class=\"fuse-slot-interscroller\" data-fuse-code=\"fuse-slot-articlepage_interscroller_2-1\" data-fuse-zone-instance=\"zone-instance-articlepage_interscroller_2-1\" data-fuse-slot=\"fuse-slot-articlepage_interscroller_2-1\" data-gpid=\"/71161633,23323634633/VELOG_velog/articlepage_interscroller_2#single-1\" data-fuse-processed-at=\"734\"><div id=\"fuse-slot-articlepage_interscroller_2-1\" class=\"fuse-slot\" style=\"max-width: inherit; max-height: inherit;\"></div></div></div>\n        </div>\n    </div><div id=\"fuse-slot-incontent_2_articlepage-1\" class=\"fuse-slot\" style=\"max-width: inherit; max-height: inherit;\"></div></div><h1 id=\"4-activation-function의-역할\">4. Activation Function의 역할</h1>\n<p>여기서 비선형 활성화 함수가 등장한다.</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{a} = f(\\mathbf{z})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.44444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">a</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>예를 들어 ReLU는 다음과 같다.</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(z)=\\max(0,z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.16666666666666666em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>ReLU는 음수 영역을 0으로 만들고 양수 영역은 그대로 전달한다.</p>\n<p>이를 공간의 관점에서 생각하면 데이터 공간의 일부를 꺾거나 압축하는 비선형 변환으로 볼 수 있다.</p>\n<p>Linear Layer가 공간을 선형적으로 변환한다면 Activation Function은 그 공간에 <strong>비선형성(Non-linearity)</strong>을 추가한다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"5-layer-하나의-역할\">5. Layer 하나의 역할</h1>\n<p>따라서 하나의 신경망 Layer를 다음처럼 생각할 수 있다.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Input Representation\n        ↓\nWx + b\n        ↓\nLinear / Affine Transformation\n        ↓\nActivation Function\n        ↓\nNon-linear Transformation\n        ↓\nNew Representation</code></pre>\n<p>이 과정이 여러 번 반복된다.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Input\n  ↓\nLinear\n  ↓\nReLU\n  ↓\nLinear\n  ↓\nReLU\n  ↓\nLinear\n  ↓\nOutput</code></pre>\n<p>각 Layer를 통과할 때마다 데이터의 표현 방식이 변한다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"6-구겨진-공간을-펴는-직관\">6. 구겨진 공간을 펴는 직관</h1>\n<p>비선형 분류 문제를 하나의 구겨진 종이로 생각해볼 수 있다.</p>\n<p>원래 공간에서는 두 클래스가 복잡하게 섞여 있다고 가정한다.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">○ ● ○\n● ○ ●\n○ ● ○</code></pre>\n<p>이 상태에서는 직선 하나로 두 클래스를 나누기 어렵다.</p>\n<p>신경망은 Layer를 통과시키면서 데이터의 표현을 계속 변화시킨다.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Complex Representation\n        ↓\nLayer 1\n        ↓\nLayer 2\n        ↓\nLayer 3\n        ↓\nSimpler Representation</code></pre>\n<p>최종적으로는 다음과 같이 두 그룹이 보다 쉽게 나뉘는 표현을 얻는 것이 목표가 될 수 있다.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">○ ○ ○ ○ | ● ● ● ●</code></pre>\n<p>그러면 마지막 단계에서는 단순한 Linear Classifier만으로도 두 클래스를 구분할 수 있다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"7-feature-representation\">7. Feature Representation</h1>\n<p>딥러닝에서 중요한 것은 원본 데이터 자체뿐만 아니라 데이터가 내부에서 <strong>어떤 표현(Representation)</strong>으로 변환되는가이다.</p>\n<p>예를 들어 이미지 데이터를 생각하면 초기에는 각 Pixel의 값만 존재한다.</p>\n<p>깊은 네트워크에서는 Layer를 거치면서 단순한 값들이 보다 의미 있는 특징으로 변환된다.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Raw Input\n   ↓\nLow-level Feature\n   ↓\nIntermediate Feature\n   ↓\nHigh-level Representation\n   ↓\nPrediction</code></pre>\n<p>즉 신경망은 데이터를 단순히 분류하는 것뿐 아니라 <strong>분류하기 좋은 표현 자체를 학습한다</strong>고 볼 수 있다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"8-딥러닝을-좌표-변환기로-보는-직관\">8. 딥러닝을 좌표 변환기로 보는 직관</h1>\n<p>이 관점에서 딥러닝을 다음과 같이 생각할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{x} \\rightarrow f_1(\\mathbf{x}) \\rightarrow f_2(f_1(\\mathbf{x})) \\rightarrow \\cdots \\rightarrow f_L(\\cdots)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.44444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.30110799999999993em\"><span style=\"top:-2.5500000000000003em;margin-left:-0.10764em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.30110799999999993em\"><span style=\"top:-2.5500000000000003em;margin-left:-0.10764em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.30110799999999993em\"><span style=\"top:-2.5500000000000003em;margin-left:-0.10764em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.36687em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.32833099999999993em\"><span style=\"top:-2.5500000000000003em;margin-left:-0.10764em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.16666666666666666em\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>원래 데이터 공간의 좌표 <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.44444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span>를 여러 번 변환하여 새로운 표현 공간으로 Mapping하는 것이다.</p>\n<p>따라서</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>딥러닝은 복잡한 데이터를 판단하기 쉬운 표현 공간으로 계속 Mapping하는 시스템이다.</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>라는 직관을 사용할 수 있다.</p>\n<p>다만 이것은 딥러닝의 엄밀한 정의라기보다, 신경망 내부에서 이루어지는 표현 변환을 이해하기 위한 기하학적 관점이다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"핵심-정리\">핵심 정리</h2>\n<p>신경망의 기본 연산</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{z} = \\mathbf{W}\\mathbf{x}+\\mathbf{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.44444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.76944em;vertical-align:-0.08333em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">W</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>에서 <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.68611em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">W</span></span></span></span></span></span>와 <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span>는 데이터 표현을 변환한다.</p>\n<p>그리고</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{a}=f(\\mathbf{z})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.44444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">a</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>의 비선형 활성화 함수가 추가되면서 단순한 선형 변환을 넘어 복잡한 표현 변환이 가능해진다.</p>\n<p>이를 여러 Layer에 걸쳐 반복하면</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mtext>Complex&nbsp;Input&nbsp;Space</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Learned&nbsp;Representation</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Simple&nbsp;Decision</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{ \\text{Complex Input Space} \\rightarrow \\text{Learned Representation} \\rightarrow \\text{Simple Decision} }</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5688799999999998em;vertical-align:-0.53444em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0344399999999998em\"><span style=\"top:-3.56888em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.56888em\"></span><span class=\"boxpad\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Complex&nbsp;Input&nbsp;Space</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Learned&nbsp;Representation</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Simple&nbsp;Decision</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.03444em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.56888em\"></span><span class=\"stretchy fbox\" style=\"height:1.5688799999999998em;border-style:solid;border-width:0.04em\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.53444em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>이라는 관점으로 딥러닝을 이해할 수 있다.</p>",
